* FD-11  Closed-loop output impedance, differential and common mode
* Spec 3.2.2.5 applied to the FD-01 network (inputs at VCOM, RL/CL load).
* Copy D: AC 1/2 A into Vop and 1/2 A out of Von; |Vop - Von| per ampere is
*   each output's closed-loop impedance.  Copy C: AC 1 A into each output;
*   (Vop + Von)/2 per ampere is the common-mode output impedance the CMFB holds.
{{SEED_OPTION}}
.lib "{{MODEL_LIB}}" {{CORNER}}
{{MC_PARAM}}
.include "{{DUT_FILE}}"
.temp {{TEMP}}
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-15 vntol=1e-9
VDD vdd 0 {{VDD}}
VSS vss 0 0
IBIAS vdd ibias {{IBIAS}}
VCM vcm 0 {{VCM}}
* Copy D
VI vi vcm 0
R1 vi inp {{R_NET}}
R2 inp outn {{R_NET}}
R3 vi inn {{R_NET}}
R4 inn outp {{R_NET}}
XDUT vss ibias vdd vcmpin inp inn outp outn {{DUT}}
RVCM_DUT vcm vcmpin 1k
RLP outp vcm {{RL}}
CLP outp 0 {{CL}}
RLN outn vcm {{RL}}
CLN outn 0 {{CL}}
IOP 0 outp DC 0 AC 0.5
ION 0 outn DC 0 AC 0.5 180
* Copy C
IBIASC vdd ibiasc {{IBIAS}}
R1C vcm inpc {{R_NET}}
R2C inpc onc {{R_NET}}
R3C vcm innc {{R_NET}}
R4C innc opc {{R_NET}}
XC vss ibiasc vdd vcmpin_c inpc innc opc onc {{DUT}}
RVCM_C vcm vcmpin_c 1k
RLPC opc vcm {{RL}}
CLPC opc 0 {{CL}}
RLNC onc vcm {{RL}}
CLNC onc 0 {{CL}}
IOPC 0 opc DC 0 AC 1
IONC 0 onc DC 0 AC 1
.control
set filetype=ascii
ac dec 50 1 1G
write {{RAW}} v(outp) v(outn) v(opc) v(onc)
.endc
.end
